Troubleshooting
===============

If anything is not working correctly, please try these troubleshooting steps
before submitting a bug report.

First install the mesa-utils, vulkan-tools, and vkd3d-demos packages:

$ sudo apt install mesa-utils vulkan-tools vkd3d-demos

Get information about your mesa GL setup:

$ glxinfo

Verify that mesa can render its examples:

$ glxgears
$ glxheads

Get information about your vulkan setup:

$ vulkaninfo

Verify that vulkan can render an example:

$ vkcube

Finally, verify that vkd3d can render its examples:

$ vkd3d-triangle
$ vkd3d-gears

If anything goes wrong, try an internet search with the error message first.
If that doesn't help, please submit a bug report against src:vkd3d with
complete output from these steps.
